WEBVTT

00:04:58.419 --> 00:05:02.256
Finally, a capstone was placed on top.

00:05:02.506 --> 00:05:05.885
Covered with electrum 
and glimmering like gold,

00:05:05.885 --> 00:05:10.723
this peak shined like
a second sun over all of Egypt.

00:05:11.599 --> 00:05:15.644
This video was made possible with support
from Marriott Hotels.

00:05:15.644 --> 00:05:19.482
With over 590 hotels and resorts 
across the globe,

00:05:19.482 --> 00:05:24.320
Marriott Hotels celebrates the curiosity
that propels us to travel.

00:05:24.487 --> 00:05:29.075
Check out some of the exciting ways 
TED-Ed and Marriott are working together

00:05:29.075 --> 00:05:32.119
and book your next journey
at Marriott Hotels.